...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
web: adk web (AgentLoader) { class: ext }
research: research_agent.yaml { class: file }
root: root_agent.yaml { class: file }

user -> web: 메시지 (POST /run)
web -> root: 로드
root -> research: sub_agents: config_path 로 재귀 로드
research -> research: tools 목록에서 args 키 검사
research -> web: ValueError (Blocked key 'args')
web -> user: HTTP 404
